            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BRH"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A variation on this recipe is to use bourbon instead of scotch. I have had this drink made as equal parts amaretto and bourbon, served over the rocks and it was delicious. The amaretto really takes the sting out of the bourbon. Goes down easy.",
            "datePublished": "2014-12-20T18:49:14.850Z"
          },
