              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lutzflcat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "5.8.20 I like Amaretto, and I like Scotch, but never in a million years would I have thought to put the two together. But I’m glad I did because I liked it. I’m going through a “not too sweet” phase right now, so I’d probably cut the amaretto back just a bit, but this was a great Friday evening cocktail.",
